  "notes": [
    "No അവൻ/അവൾ or -കാരൻ/-കാരി agent nouns for the player or {name}; other players are എന്നയാൾ (person), അവർ (respectful plural) or the name.",
    "Dravidian suffixes (-ന്റെ, -ന്, -ൽ, -ഓ) are never attached to a placeholder or #: sentences use a colon or a noun after the placeholder (എന്നയാളുടെ, ലെവൽ, സമയം).",
    "Plural branches follow Intl.PluralRules('ml'): one (1 only) and other (0 and 2+).",
    "Generated names use the default order (first part, space, second part): Malayalam puts the modifier before the noun with no gender agreement (ഇടിമിന്നൽ + കൊടുമുടി = ഇടിമിന്നൽ കൊടുമുടി). Recorded in TERMS.md; generatedNames stays unset.",
    "Japanese given names and family names are transliterated into Malayalam script (കൈറ്റോ, ടകേഡ); Kagemura and store/platform brands stay in Latin letters.",
    "The Japanese statutory pages are translated into Malayalam, as in Vietnamese; the support page links them by their Japanese titles.",
    "Script-share warnings come from Latin brand and technical words (Kagemura, IndexedDB, App Store) and from the checker counting Malayalam vowel signs as marks, not letters; length warnings on the Japanese statutory page titles are expected."
